menu "SparkFun SSD168x Library"

    config SFE_SSD168X_SPI_CLOCK_HZ
        int "Default SPI clock speed (Hz)"
        range 100000 20000000
        default 4000000
        help
            The default SPI (SCLK) clock speed used for the e-Paper display. The SSD1680/1 supports up to 20MHz for writes.
            The clock speed can also be passed to begin().

endmenu
